# With no creature on the battlefield there is nothing Clone may copy, so it is not asked whether to (CR 707.2,
# 614.1c): the refusal "! Bot1.Accept" holds across its resolution. Mox Sapphire, an artifact but not a creature, is no
# candidate (Phyrexian Metamorph could copy it; Clone cannot). Clone enters as the printed 0/0 and dies (CR 704.5f).
# The positive control is clone-enters-as-a-copy-of-an-ornithopter, where the same cast with a creature out asks.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Clone
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clone.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Graveyard = Clone; Black Lotus
